## Q1. Tell me about yourself?

### Best answer

Good afternoon, sir.

My name is Harshad Rakshe, and I am from Pune, Maharashtra. I have completed my Bachelor’s degree in Computer Engineering.

Recently, I developed a project called Sankalp – Restaurant Management System. It is a web-based application designed to manage restaurant operations including menu management, customer management, order management, billing, kitchen management, and reports.

In this project, I worked with Java, Spring Boot, JDBC, MySQL, JSP, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. I also implemented features like JWT-based authentication, role-based access, validation, file upload, and REST APIs.

I am a quick learner and always eager to learn and explore new technologies. I enjoy solving problems and improving my technical skills through practical projects.

That’s all about me. Thank you, sir.

### Short version

My name is Harshad Rakshe. I completed my Bachelor’s in Computer Engineering and have hands-on experience with Java, Spring Boot, JDBC, MySQL, and frontend technologies. I worked on a restaurant management project that included order management, billing, authentication, and REST APIs. I am a quick learner, eager to grow, and interested in joining a company where I can contribute and learn.

